WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.890
MAID Still-Sitting MP Dossier.

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:09.943
This page cross-references ninety-seven currently serving Members of Parliament who voted for MAID — Medical Assistance in Dying.

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:19.306
Each MP's vote record on Bill C-14 and Bill C-7 is documented with Hansard links, lobbying contact counts, and open parliament profiles.

00:00:19.306 --> 00:00:26.579
Forty-six MPs voted for both C-14 and C-7 — meaning they voted twice to expand the killing of Canadians.

00:00:26.579 --> 00:00:30.931
Every vote is publicly verifiable through the House of Commons Hansard record.
